                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "71f55301-0ab7-335e-bdfa-ab5474c1dcd6",
                                        "entry_id": "8acf1eaa-83c5-3f4d-8b7a-cd8f04183d1d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A unique power of the mind; a faculty."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "969bcffc-ae76-3de8-acc4-179c8f481056",
                                        "entry_id": "8acf1eaa-83c5-3f4d-8b7a-cd8f04183d1d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A skill or competence in doing; mental power; talent; aptitude."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4e011940-2e13-4bd3-b501-2a7f30cd0465",
                                                "sense_id": "969bcffc-ae76-3de8-acc4-179c8f481056",
                                                "text": "a mixed-ability class"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "37316dd0-29bb-49d4-b7b8-807b05609da7",
                                                "sense_id": "969bcffc-ae76-3de8-acc4-179c8f481056",
                                                "text": "They are persons of ability, who will go far in life."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "767f96e6-1613-47fd-a955-1f5efcbf388a",
                                                "sense_id": "969bcffc-ae76-3de8-acc4-179c8f481056",
                                                "text": "She has an uncanny ability to defuse conflict."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ec804289-4bf2-450e-aa5e-ffef304b1719",
                                                "sense_id": "969bcffc-ae76-3de8-acc4-179c8f481056",
                                                "text": "Then the disciples, euery man according to his abilitie, determined to send reliefe vnto the brethren which dwelt in Iudea."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a8a175a4-f98f-4215-8197-eb7a706b7d1e",
                                                "sense_id": "969bcffc-ae76-3de8-acc4-179c8f481056",
                                                "text": "The public men of England, with much of a peculiar kind of ability"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d682dbda-1e63-4141-868a-2fae2faff5cf",
                                                "sense_id": "969bcffc-ae76-3de8-acc4-179c8f481056",
                                                "text": "Natural abilities are like natural plants, that need pruning by study -"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d80b6e0f-1821-441b-afc8-594e8738fcf9",
                                                "sense_id": "969bcffc-ae76-3de8-acc4-179c8f481056",
                                                "text": "The most persistent tormentor was Alex Oxlade-Chamberlain, who scored a hat-trick in last month’s corresponding fixture in Iceland. His ability to run at defences is instantly striking, but it is his clever use of possession that has persuaded some shrewd judges that he is an even better prospect than Theo Walcott."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
